        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Guys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.poster.avif?t=1785763740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.webm?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.mp4?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Ultimate Competitive Racing Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Car Guys</i>, an exciting arcade racing game where skill and strategy come together in fast-paced, action-packed competitions. Race online for your nation — or go offline and conquer the brand-new single-player Championship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Online modes require an active internet connection. The Championship mode is fully playable offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 NEW — Championship Mode (Single-Player)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pick one of 10 unique characters, each with their own car and nationality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle rival racers across a 5-race tournament with overall standings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reverse-grid starts: the leader starts last — no easy victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Climb the podium in the final ceremony and earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully offline — no connection needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏙️ NEW — Circuit City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tear through a brand-new urban circuit: dodge traffic blockers, thread the cones and master every shortcut of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Real-Time Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Race against players from around the world in thrilling, high-speed competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy a seamless and lag-free experience powered by <strong>Photon Quantum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 Compete for Your Nation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose your country and contribute to its position on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prove which nation dominates the track and rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏎️ Action-Packed Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pick up power-ups like missiles and shields to outmaneuver your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smarter AI racers that fight back with everything they've got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master both offensive and defensive driving strategies to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Vibrant Visuals &amp; Optimized Performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience colorful graphics, dynamic environments and per-track music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Smooth gameplay at <strong>60 FPS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏁 Extensive Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Personalize your vehicles with unique skins, decals, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose from sleek sports cars to rugged off-road machines—the possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 Competitive Events &amp; Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Participate in <strong>daily and weekly championships</strong> with exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock <strong>new tracks, vehicles, and upgrades</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌐 Play in Your Language</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In-game language selector: English, Spanish, French, German, Italian and Portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.poster.avif?t=1785763740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.webm?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.mp4?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
