hips</strong> with exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock <strong>new tracks, vehicles, and upgrades</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌐 Play in Your Language</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In-game language selector: English, Spanish, French, German, Italian and Portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.poster.avif?t=1785763740\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.webm?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.mp4?t=1785763740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
